{
    "title": "GuitarTuna: Tuner,Chords,Tabs",
    "description": "GuitarTuna is your go-to guitar app, with over 100 million downloads and counting! Tune your guitar in seconds with the free guitar tuner, explore guitar chords & tabs for 20,000+ songs, and learn how to play guitar songs you love with trainers, tutorials & personalized feedback.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU\u2019LL LOVE GUITARTUNA\r\n- Tune any guitar, ukulele, violin or bass perfectly with easy-to-use tuning\r\n- Switch seamlessly between guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner & more\r\n- Get guitar tabs & chords for your favorite songs\r\n- Learn guitar songs with trainers, tutorials & personalized feedback\r\n- Practice like a pro with essential tools for guitar\r\n- Play songs you love at any skill level \u2013 guitar beginners included!\r\n- Become a better guitar player with an all-in-one guitar app in your pocket\r\n\r\nDesigned by professional guitarists and audio engineers, GuitarTuna is the ultimate guitar tuning app \u2013 now with even more features, including guitar tabs!\r\nDownload to start tuning and playing guitar for free.\r\n\r\nTUNE YOUR INSTRUMENT IN SECONDS\r\n- 15 instrument tuners\r\n- Guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner, violin tuner & more\r\n- 100+ tunings: Standard tuning, custom tuning & more\r\n- Tune using your device\u2019s built-in microphone. No cables needed!\r\n- Pluck a string & GuitarTuna\u2019s real-time tuner will tell you when you\u2019re in tune\r\n- Professional accuracy with advanced sound recognition\r\n\r\nPLAY SONGS WITH GUITAR TABS & CHORDS\r\n- Explore guitar tabs for 20,000+ popular songs by top global artists\r\n- Get pro-quality guitar chords & guitar tabs\r\n- Choose guitar tabs & chords for your skill level\r\n- Play at your own pace while chords & tabs sync with you\r\n- Request guitar tabs & chords for your favorite songs\r\n- New guitar songs & tabs added weekly!\r\n\r\nLEARN SONGS WITH GUITAR TUTORIALS\r\n- Learn guitar songs with video tutorials & interactive trainers\r\n- Get personalized feedback to improve your guitar playing\r\n- Create your own personalized learning path\r\n- Get tips from expert guitarists\r\n\r\nTOOLS TO PRACTICE GUITAR LIKE A PRO\r\n- Metronome: Set your tempo & customize your time signature with the metronome tool\r\n- Chord games: G chord giving you trouble? Learn, practice & master guitar chords with customizable games.\r\n- Ear trainer: Improve your music skills & recognize chords by ear\r\n- Chord library: Explore guitar chords with diagrams & audio\r\n- Left-hand mode: Easily switch between right & left hand modes\r\n\r\nTUNE GUITAR, UKULELE, BASS & MORE\r\n- Electric guitar tuner\r\n- Acoustic guitar tuner\r\n- Guitar tuner: 6-string, 7-string, 12-string\r\n- Bass tuner: 4-string\r\n- Bass tuner: 5-string\r\n- Ukulele tuner\r\n- Violin tuner\r\n- Viola tuner\r\n- Cello tuner\r\n- Fiddle tuner\r\n- Mandolin tuner\r\n- Banjo tuner: 4-string, 5-string\r\n- Balalaika tuner\r\n- Cavaquinho tuner\r\n\r\nEXPLORE 100+ TUNINGS\r\n- Standard guitar tuner free to use\r\n- Custom tuning\r\n- Drop-D, Drop-C, Drop-A & other drop tuning\r\n- Open tuning\r\n- Half step down tuning\r\n- Alternate tuning: Explore popular tunings for guitar, ukulele & more\r\n- Chromatic tuner: Tune to any note on the chromatic scale\r\n\r\nFIRST TIME USING A GUITAR OR UKULELE TUNER?\r\nTo avoid damage, we recommend watching a YouTube tutorial before using any guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner or violin tuner.\r\n\r\nSHARE YOUR FEEDBACK\r\nWant to help us make GuitarTuna an even better guitar app? Send your suggestions to: support@guitartuna.com \r\n\r\nReady to play? Download the #1 free guitar tuning app now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "GuitarTuna is your go-to guitar app, with over 100 million downloads and counting! Tune your guitar in seconds with the free guitar tuner, explore guitar chords &amp; tabs for 20,000+ songs, and learn how to play guitar songs you love with trainers, tutorials &amp; personalized feedback.<br><br>WHY YOU\u2019LL LOVE GUITARTUNA<br>- Tune any guitar, ukulele, violin or bass perfectly with easy-to-use tuning<br>- Switch seamlessly between guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner &amp; more<br>- Get guitar tabs &amp; chords for your favorite songs<br>- Learn guitar songs with trainers, tutorials &amp; personalized feedback<br>- Practice like a pro with essential tools for guitar<br>- Play songs you love at any skill level \u2013 guitar beginners included!<br>- Become a better guitar player with an all-in-one guitar app in your pocket<br><br>Designed by professional guitarists and audio engineers, GuitarTuna is the ultimate guitar tuning app \u2013 now with even more features, including guitar tabs!<br>Download to start tuning and playing guitar for free.<br><br>TUNE YOUR INSTRUMENT IN SECONDS<br>- 15 instrument tuners<br>- Guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner, violin tuner &amp; more<br>- 100+ tunings: Standard tuning, custom tuning &amp; more<br>- Tune using your device\u2019s built-in microphone. No cables needed!<br>- Pluck a string &amp; GuitarTuna\u2019s real-time tuner will tell you when you\u2019re in tune<br>- Professional accuracy with advanced sound recognition<br><br>PLAY SONGS WITH GUITAR TABS &amp; CHORDS<br>- Explore guitar tabs for 20,000+ popular songs by top global artists<br>- Get pro-quality guitar chords &amp; guitar tabs<br>- Choose guitar tabs &amp; chords for your skill level<br>- Play at your own pace while chords &amp; tabs sync with you<br>- Request guitar tabs &amp; chords for your favorite songs<br>- New guitar songs &amp; tabs added weekly!<br><br>LEARN SONGS WITH GUITAR TUTORIALS<br>- Learn guitar songs with video tutorials &amp; interactive trainers<br>- Get personalized feedback to improve your guitar playing<br>- Create your own personalized learning path<br>- Get tips from expert guitarists<br><br>TOOLS TO PRACTICE GUITAR LIKE A PRO<br>- Metronome: Set your tempo &amp; customize your time signature with the metronome tool<br>- Chord games: G chord giving you trouble? Learn, practice &amp; master guitar chords with customizable games.<br>- Ear trainer: Improve your music skills &amp; recognize chords by ear<br>- Chord library: Explore guitar chords with diagrams &amp; audio<br>- Left-hand mode: Easily switch between right &amp; left hand modes<br><br>TUNE GUITAR, UKULELE, BASS &amp; MORE<br>- Electric guitar tuner<br>- Acoustic guitar tuner<br>- Guitar tuner: 6-string, 7-string, 12-string<br>- Bass tuner: 4-string<br>- Bass tuner: 5-string<br>- Ukulele tuner<br>- Violin tuner<br>- Viola tuner<br>- Cello tuner<br>- Fiddle tuner<br>- Mandolin tuner<br>- Banjo tuner: 4-string, 5-string<br>- Balalaika tuner<br>- Cavaquinho tuner<br><br>EXPLORE 100+ TUNINGS<br>- Standard guitar tuner free to use<br>- Custom tuning<br>- Drop-D, Drop-C, Drop-A &amp; other drop tuning<br>- Open tuning<br>- Half step down tuning<br>- Alternate tuning: Explore popular tunings for guitar, ukulele &amp; more<br>- Chromatic tuner: Tune to any note on the chromatic scale<br><br>FIRST TIME USING A GUITAR OR UKULELE TUNER?<br>To avoid damage, we recommend watching a YouTube tutorial before using any guitar tuner, ukulele tuner, bass tuner or violin tuner.<br><br>SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK<br>Want to help us make GuitarTuna an even better guitar app? Send your suggestions to: support@guitartuna.com <br><br>Ready to play? Download the #1 free guitar tuning app now!",
